# Route: guide 37 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Undead
# (1199 of 1215 eligible quests, 157.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 56 to
# 58, 58 quests, 3.5 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Hillsbrad Foothills, Tirisfal Glades, Feralas, Thousand Needles,
# Moonglade, Winterspring, Western Plaguelands, Swamp of Sorrows): Tarren Mill
# -> Southshore -> Tarren Mill -> Durnholde Keep -> Tarren Mill -> Hillsbrad
# Fields -> Azurelode Mine -> Southshore -> Tarren Mill -> The Bulwark ->
# Felstone Field -> The Bulwark -> Camp Mojache -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): The Crown of Will (518; Crushridge
# Mauler 36-37); The Crown of Will (519; Targ 41, Muckrake 40, Glommus 39);
# Encrusted Tail Fins (1107; Saltscale Warrior 35-36, Saltscale Oracle 36-37,
# Saltscale Tide Lord 37, Saltscale Forager 35-36, Saltscale Hunter 35-36); A
# Host of Evil (6626; Razorfen Battleguard 33-34, Razorfen Thornweaver 33-34,
# Death's Head Cultist 33-34).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): The Grave Knight (96986), Vorrel's Revenge (1051), Barov
# Family Fortune (5341), The Wrath of Rath'mael (92422), The Wrath of
# Rath'mael (92422), Crest of Lordaeron (95204), Unending Torment (97288),
# Pusillin and the Elder Azj'Tordin (7441), Elven Legends (7481),
# Lethtendris's Web (7489), Gahz'rilla (2770), Doctor Theolen Krastinov, the
# Butcher (5382), Kirtonos the Herald (5384), The Lich, Ras Frostwhisper
# (5466), Krastinov's Bag of Horrors (5515), Of Love and Family (5848), Oculus
# Illusions (6569).

